  "name": "Zeratul",
  "role": "Melee Assassin",
  "overview": "Zeratul is a mobile Melee Assassin. Teleporting in and out of fights, he is able to deal massive amounts of burst damage to high-priority backline Heroes unpunished, or temporarily remove them from the fight or set up large combos with Void Prison. Zeratul is permanently Stealthed, allowing him to stalk his targets whilst unseen.",
  "strengths": [
